# Adieu, Lilisette (WotG 38), with Bonds of Mythril completed, in Southern San d'Oria [S]. Rholont at allegiance 0 plays
# nothing of the mission's: his DefaultActions event 32, finished. Lion Springs plays 166 [0] (the allegiance); its
# finish completes the mission (By the Fading Light current).
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Lion_Springs/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/Rholont/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/166
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=96,0,106 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
quest CrystalWar.BondsOfMythril completed
mission Wotg AdieuLilisette current
login
trigger Rholont                            # allegiance 0
finish-if-event
trigger Lion_Springs                       # 166
finish                                     # completed
